{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40595","headline":"句 · 裴说","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"读书贫里乐，搜句静中忙。\n苦吟僧入定，得句将成功。\n是事精皆易，唯诗会却难。\n因携一家住，赢得半年吟。\n吟余潮入浦，坐久烧移山。\n三年清似水，六月冷如冰。\n一通红锦重，三事紫罗轻。\n瘦肌寒带粟，病眼馁生花。\n避乱一生多，雪留寒竹寺舍冷。\n风撼早梅城郭香，画球轻蹴壶中地。\n彩索高飞掌上身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}